00:42:39.220 --> 00:42:39.430
How may I help you?

00:42:39.640 --> 00:42:43.140
I'm a helix inspector from the World Health Organization.

00:42:43.350 --> 00:42:46.230
I'm here concerning yesterday's simultaneous mass suicide--

00:42:46.440 --> 00:42:49.610
I saw it on the news this morning, but what does that have to do with us--

00:42:49.810 --> 00:42:51.820
It's about your daughter.

00:42:52.980 --> 00:42:56.150
My daughter passed away over ten years ago.

00:42:56.360 --> 00:43:00.910
I am aware of that. I would like to ask about the time before she died.

00:43:01.120 --> 00:43:03.740
Before she died...

00:43:03.950 --> 00:43:06.290
Please come in.

00:43:07.620 --> 00:43:12.250
That girl tried to kill herself so many times.

00:43:12.460 --> 00:43:16.590
Yes. That's in the records.

00:43:16.800 --> 00:43:21.930
Miach was so clever and strong that she was beyond our control.

00:43:22.140 --> 00:43:24.560
But despite that, she was a sensitive child.

00:43:24.770 --> 00:43:29.060
We showed her our utmost affection.

00:43:29.270 --> 00:43:31.400
But, of course...

00:43:31.610 --> 00:43:32.980
Of course?

00:43:33.190 --> 00:43:36.440
Miach was adopted.

00:43:38.860 --> 00:43:41.570
That's not on record.

00:43:41.780 --> 00:43:45.200
I don't know if it was
Admedistrative policy or concern, but...

00:43:45.410 --> 00:43:47.750
Remember the war in Chechnya?

00:43:47.960 --> 00:43:51.130
Yes. It continues even now.

00:43:51.330 --> 00:43:57.550
They told us she belonged to an ethnic minority near the war zone.

00:43:57.760 --> 00:43:59.380
A war orphan...

00:43:59.590 --> 00:44:01.640
They didn't give us the details,

00:44:01.840 --> 00:44:06.850
but they said she had some truly terrible experiences in the conflict zone.

00:44:07.060 --> 00:44:11.600
She received intensive therapy treatments for the mental trauma.

00:44:11.810 --> 00:44:15.360
Because she was still so young at eight years old when we got her,

00:44:15.570 --> 00:44:21.030
they said if we provided her with a loving family environment, then she'd soon settle in.

00:44:21.240 --> 00:44:26.160
But Miach took that pill and died.

00:44:26.370 --> 00:44:33.170
What can a parent do when a child goes beyond what they can imagine?

00:44:34.920 --> 00:44:36.840
Miach's profound darkness

00:44:37.050 --> 00:44:42.050
that she told no one about... not even me.

00:44:42.260 --> 00:44:47.930
Even after being rescued from that hellish place, she hated Japan...

00:44:48.140 --> 00:44:53.230
Hated this world that's like a fake paradise.

00:44:54.360 --> 00:44:59.990
When we moved here, we got rid of most of her things.

00:45:00.190 --> 00:45:04.320
But that's the one thing
I couldn't throw away...

00:45:13.120 --> 00:45:15.380
Do you know what a business card is?

00:45:15.580 --> 00:45:18.300
Long ago, this was the extent of your personal information.

00:45:18.500 --> 00:45:21.880
It informs only the people you want to inform.

00:45:22.090 --> 00:45:23.970
It's our logo.

00:45:24.180 --> 00:45:27.300
--How cute.
--Seriously!

00:45:31.230 --> 00:45:35.310
The whereabouts of
Miach's body were not recorded.

00:45:35.520 --> 00:45:37.610
I wonder if it was sent back to Chechnya.

00:45:37.820 --> 00:45:42.320
A researcher said he wanted to take Miach's body...

00:45:42.530 --> 00:45:46.240
Before she died, she wanted to donate.

00:45:46.450 --> 00:45:48.330
And the name of that researcher?

00:45:48.530 --> 00:45:53.000
I don't know. I couldn't even have direct contact for security reasons.

00:45:53.210 --> 00:45:59.840
I'm an international investigator. I've been legally given top investigative authority.

00:46:00.050 --> 00:46:02.800
Excuse me, but I must verify this.

00:46:08.470 --> 00:46:13.020
Destination of body?

00:46:08.470 --> 00:46:13.020
Tokyo College of Health Informatics

00:46:08.470 --> 00:46:13.020
Researcher: Keita Saeki

00:46:13.020 --> 00:46:16.520
Tokyo College of Health Informatics

00:46:13.020 --> 00:46:16.520
Researcher: Keita Saeki

00:46:18.480 --> 00:46:20.400
Keita Saeki?!

00:46:20.610 --> 00:46:25.030
He's the researcher who wrote the technical paper that was the basis for WatchMe.

00:46:27.990 --> 00:46:32.790
My father, Nuada Kirie, worked in his lab.

00:46:33.000 --> 00:46:38.040
Thirteen years ago, my father suddenly disappeared from our family.

00:46:38.250 --> 00:46:42.840
Immediately after I tried to die with Miach and Cian...

00:46:45.010 --> 00:46:48.300
I've been waiting. Come on in.

00:46:48.300 --> 00:46:48.890
I've been waiting. Come on in.

00:46:49.090 --> 00:46:52.470
Professor Saeki, you seem to be well.

00:46:51.680 --> 00:47:00.610
6F Neuromedical Behavioral Neuroscience Lab

00:46:51.680 --> 00:47:00.610
Neuromedical Center / Conference Room D

00:46:51.680 --> 00:47:00.610
5F Neuromedical Developmental Neuroscience

00:46:51.680 --> 00:47:00.610
4F Neuromedical Systems Neuroscience Lab

00:46:52.680 --> 00:46:57.020
In this age there isn't anyone who isn't well.

00:46:57.230 --> 00:47:00.610
Since illness has mostly become a thing of the past.

00:47:00.610 --> 00:47:01.110
Since illness has mostly become a thing of the past.

00:47:01.320 --> 00:47:06.700
Well, I've always wanted to ask the father of WatchMe that question.

00:47:06.900 --> 00:47:11.870
I'd never have predicted such an extreme health society was possible.

00:47:12.080 --> 00:47:16.040
It's a reaction to the great cataclysm known as The Maelstrom.

00:47:16.250 --> 00:47:19.830
Wasn't it your generation who wanted this?

00:47:20.040 --> 00:47:22.670
When the disaster happened half a century ago,

00:47:22.880 --> 00:47:27.470
over ten million lives were lost in North America alone.

00:47:27.670 --> 00:47:31.220
The outflow of nuclear warheads bred terrorism around the world,

00:47:31.430 --> 00:47:35.470
spreading chaos and violence on a global scale.

00:47:35.680 --> 00:47:38.850
This is a reaction to the fear of the people now in control of 70 or 80 Admedistrations--

00:47:39.060 --> 00:47:42.690
a fear that has never gone away.

00:47:42.900 --> 00:47:46.030
I'm one of them, of course.

00:47:46.240 --> 00:47:49.240
But you didn't come here to listen to such tales.

00:47:49.450 --> 00:47:54.700
Since you're a WHO investigator,
I assume this is about yesterday's incident.

00:47:54.910 --> 00:47:57.870
It's about Miach Mihie.

00:47:58.080 --> 00:48:00.920
What was the purpose of taking her body?

00:48:02.750 --> 00:48:07.670
The body wasn't taken here. Am I correct?

00:48:07.880 --> 00:48:13.550
If it was only transported to this lab, normal protocol should have been fine.

00:48:13.760 --> 00:48:15.810
It was my father.

00:48:16.010 --> 00:48:20.690
The one who took the body was Nuada Kirie.
And so it was likely sent overseas.

00:48:20.890 --> 00:48:23.150
Now, now, I haven't said anything.

00:48:23.360 --> 00:48:24.770
I don't have time for this!

00:48:24.980 --> 00:48:31.240
Aren't you, and possibly my father, involved somehow with this incident?

00:48:32.950 --> 00:48:34.950
I'll get a warrant from the Japanese police.

00:48:35.160 --> 00:48:38.750
You've become quite the ball breaker, young lady.

00:48:38.950 --> 00:48:44.420
It's an occupational disease. It can put its victims in worse condition than this, though.

00:48:46.500 --> 00:48:52.050
Baghdad. He crossed into Baghdad for certain research.

00:48:52.260 --> 00:48:55.050
He isn't eternally my student.

00:48:55.260 --> 00:48:57.760
He continued on, but I stayed still.

00:48:57.970 --> 00:49:01.270
I haven't communicated with Nuada once since that day.

00:49:01.480 --> 00:49:03.440
And that research would be?

00:49:04.480 --> 00:49:08.860
Three years ago, a Russian scholar presented a thesis about the behavior

00:49:09.070 --> 00:49:12.700
of an area called the mid-brain reward system.

00:49:12.900 --> 00:49:18.700
To put it simply, it was a theory of human will.

00:49:18.910 --> 00:49:22.710
Do you understand?
The flashing area is a part of the mid-brain.

00:49:22.910 --> 00:49:29.050
The nuclei and lateral ventricles in this area control human desires.

00:49:29.250 --> 00:49:32.170
People tend to think that human will is something coherent,

00:49:32.380 --> 00:49:38.180
something like one soul with the potential to make levelheaded decisions.

00:49:38.390 --> 00:49:39.640
It's not?

00:49:39.850 --> 00:49:41.850
Envision a meeting.

00:49:42.060 --> 00:49:46.270
Various people are arguing for the things they individually seek.

00:49:46.480 --> 00:49:50.110
The "will" inside a person's brain is the same thing.

00:49:50.320 --> 00:49:54.860
It's just a bunch of different desires selfishly clamoring for attention.

00:49:55.070 --> 00:50:00.450
However, despite this, humans will act on one choice.

00:50:00.660 --> 00:50:05.750
Why? Because within our brains, desires are closely tied to the reward system.

00:50:05.960 --> 00:50:08.750
We're talking about offering treats.

00:50:08.960 --> 00:50:12.840
Nuada conjectured that one could control human will

00:50:13.050 --> 00:50:17.140
by tampering with the reward system for desires.

00:50:17.340 --> 00:50:20.640
Mind control...

00:50:20.850 --> 00:50:24.810
As expected, my father is connected to this incident.

00:50:25.020 --> 00:50:29.560
I don't know that. But a daughter should trust her own father--

00:50:29.770 --> 00:50:31.780
My father threw away his family!

00:50:31.980 --> 00:50:36.700
And what's more, I don't know where he is or what he's thinking!

00:50:38.160 --> 00:50:42.370
Tampering with the human soul is fascinating research.

00:50:42.580 --> 00:50:46.290
I understand wanting to pursue that--it's in a scholar's nature.

00:50:46.500 --> 00:50:50.040
I will head for Baghdad.
To look for Miach's body.

00:50:50.250 --> 00:50:53.760
Even if that means cornering my father.

00:51:01.720 --> 00:51:04.680
Would you like a ride to the airport?

00:51:07.100 --> 00:51:08.980
Baghdad, eh?

00:51:09.190 --> 00:51:11.940
How do you know this? Who are you?

00:51:12.150 --> 00:51:15.400
Forgive me,
I'm using isolation mode privileges.

00:51:15.610 --> 00:51:19.610
I'm Elijah Vashlov, an investigator from Interpol.

00:51:19.820 --> 00:51:22.490
Do you know what this is?

00:51:24.660 --> 00:51:25.540
A business card.

00:51:25.750 --> 00:51:27.710
Aw, you're no fun.

00:51:27.910 --> 00:51:30.960
I hope you don't do that with everyone you meet.

00:51:31.170 --> 00:51:33.670
It usually goes over better.

00:51:38.680 --> 00:51:40.970
Everyone's scared.

00:51:41.180 --> 00:51:48.810
In the face of what might be coming, the city is more silent than it's ever been.

00:51:49.020 --> 00:51:55.690
People dying in front of your eyes is something they assumed would never happen to them.

00:51:55.900 --> 00:51:59.570
Now therapy centers are bursting at the seams.

00:51:59.780 --> 00:52:03.370
Everyone had thought they would go their entire lives

00:52:03.580 --> 00:52:06.870
without ever seeing something so distasteful.

00:52:07.080 --> 00:52:13.040
Because it was taken for granted that we were all social resources who cared for each other.

00:52:13.250 --> 00:52:16.630
The world was like a fake paradise.

00:52:19.340 --> 00:52:21.130
You're not scared?

00:52:21.340 --> 00:52:24.300
Of course I'm scared!

00:52:27.640 --> 00:52:34.900
The section I'm in at Interpol has been secretly investigating a certain group for about a year.

00:52:35.110 --> 00:52:36.270
Group?

00:52:36.480 --> 00:52:43.200
They call themselves the "Next Gen Human Behavior Working Group."

00:52:43.410 --> 00:52:47.910
Its members include Admedistration and medical-industrial complex bigwigs,

00:52:48.120 --> 00:52:52.830
researchers, scientists and the like... all elders who don't age anymore.

00:52:53.040 --> 00:52:55.540
That's an awfully long name.

00:52:55.750 --> 00:53:00.010
Their thinking is to prepare so that humanity doesn't slide back

00:53:00.220 --> 00:53:02.840
into chaos and savagery again.

00:53:03.050 --> 00:53:05.890
There's still no consensus about the origin of the great cataclysm,

00:53:06.100 --> 00:53:09.850
but if nothing else, it proved that the human mind can revert to savagery

00:53:10.060 --> 00:53:12.520
in the blink of an eye.

00:53:12.730 --> 00:53:15.730
The untold number of human deaths showed us that.

00:53:15.940 --> 00:53:21.900
So these people used WatchMe and made it possible to monitor all of humankind.

00:53:22.110 --> 00:53:24.360
Monitor all humankind?

00:53:24.570 --> 00:53:28.240
Such a grand conspiracy theory.
How would such a thing even work?

00:53:28.450 --> 00:53:31.540
This group has secured loopholes that can

00:53:31.750 --> 00:53:35.880
illegally interfere with all WatchMe and MediCare connected to people.

00:53:36.080 --> 00:53:37.670
Using a certain technology,

00:53:37.880 --> 00:53:42.550
they exploited those security holes to research the control of human consciousness.

00:53:42.760 --> 00:53:43.930
Control of consciousness...?

00:53:44.130 --> 00:53:49.220
Yes. The incident was an experiment for them to test the device.

00:53:49.430 --> 00:53:52.480
Thousands of people wanted to commit suicide due to an experiment

00:53:52.680 --> 00:53:55.560
by an organization frightened of past disasters?

00:54:01.610 --> 00:54:04.070
I want to enlist your cooperation.

00:54:04.280 --> 00:54:07.570
No, actually, I want to cooperate with your investigation.

00:54:07.780 --> 00:54:10.540
Within Interpol there are people who do not think kindly

00:54:10.740 --> 00:54:15.370
of helix inspectors interfering with this situation.

00:54:15.580 --> 00:54:18.670
They say the WHO's interference is nothing more than a farce aimed to

00:54:18.880 --> 00:54:24.720
expand the authority of Lifeism among the international community.

00:54:24.930 --> 00:54:26.640
That's for sure.

00:54:31.260 --> 00:54:37.100
It's not the time to say such things.
Before they can make their next move--

00:54:37.310 --> 00:54:43.110
Excuse me. It's a report on Network 24. Have a look!

00:54:43.320 --> 00:54:44.740
We have an emergency report.

00:54:44.950 --> 00:54:49.160
Now Network 24 will broadcast an emergency report.

00:54:49.370 --> 00:54:53.330
We received a message addressed to
Network 24 from a person claiming to be

00:54:53.540 --> 00:54:57.670
behind the other day's simultaneous mass suicide.

00:54:57.870 --> 00:55:00.210
I'll begin by playing it for you.

00:55:05.920 --> 00:55:11.010
Not long ago, many people took their own lives.

00:55:11.220 --> 00:55:13.720
It was probably a great shock.

00:55:13.930 --> 00:55:19.520
You likely felt fear at the sight of someone suddenly dying before your eyes.

00:55:19.730 --> 00:55:23.320
That is what we have done.

00:55:23.530 --> 00:55:27.700
How we did it is a secret for now.

00:55:27.900 --> 00:55:34.740
Our methods are now rooted deeply in everyone's minds and cannot be stripped away.

00:55:34.950 --> 00:55:39.250
You all are now our hostages.

00:55:39.460 --> 00:55:40.540
Terrifying.

00:55:40.750 --> 00:55:42.090
Maddening.

00:55:42.290 --> 00:55:45.590
We're sure you have various feelings about it.

00:55:45.800 --> 00:55:47.550
Your feelings are genuine.

00:55:47.760 --> 00:55:49.970
Value them.

00:55:50.180 --> 00:55:55.970
We are living in a society in which we must repress such feelings.

00:55:56.180 --> 00:56:02.980
It's not written anywhere, it's not even a law, but we're bound by that sort of atmosphere.

00:56:03.190 --> 00:56:10.320
Did you know that children's suicide is on the rise? Everyone wants to run away.

00:56:11.410 --> 00:56:16.450
We will make a new world.
This is a proclamation.

00:56:16.660 --> 00:56:21.370
To do this we first must choose people who can do this.

00:56:21.580 --> 00:56:27.210
Everyone, within a week from now, please kill at least one person.

00:56:27.420 --> 00:56:29.670
You can use whatever method you like.

00:56:29.880 --> 00:56:35.430
Please prove that no one else matters other than yourself.

00:56:35.640 --> 00:56:40.890
Unleash the feeling of the most important thing to you being your own life.

00:56:41.100 --> 00:56:50.650
If you hesitate to take someone else's life, we will then kill you without mercy.

00:56:50.860 --> 00:56:54.160
We will induce you to take your own life.

00:56:54.370 --> 00:56:58.330
We can do this with the push of a button.

00:56:58.540 --> 00:57:03.960
For those who still don't believe us, please take a look at this image as proof.

00:57:04.170 --> 00:57:06.500
It will likely only be shown for a moment.

00:57:06.710 --> 00:57:09.800
Make sure you don't miss it.

00:57:14.470 --> 00:57:19.060
That is all the voice data that was sent to Network 24.

00:57:19.270 --> 00:57:22.190
We couldn't identify the sender.

00:57:22.390 --> 00:57:23.350
I repeat.

00:57:23.560 --> 00:57:25.150
The person identifying themselves as the perpetrator

00:57:25.360 --> 00:57:28.190
of the simultaneous mass suicide from the other day--

00:57:34.950 --> 00:57:37.700
Shit! I saw it!

00:57:37.910 --> 00:57:40.160
A proclamation...

00:57:40.370 --> 00:57:42.580
It's Miach Mihie!

00:57:42.790 --> 00:57:46.500
Those are Miach Mihie's words!

00:57:55.760 --> 00:57:58.390
<i>The Sorrows of Young Werther.</i>

00:57:58.600 --> 00:58:02.060
This book killed a number of people.

00:58:02.270 --> 00:58:04.980
How can a book kill someone?

00:58:05.190 --> 00:58:08.860
There was a girl that the main character, Werther, loved,

00:58:09.070 --> 00:58:12.240
but she was engaged to another man.

00:58:12.440 --> 00:58:18.530
It's a story about Werther taking his own life because he can't stand having an unrequited love.

00:58:18.740 --> 00:58:22.830
Sounds like a love story, but how does it kill people?

00:58:23.040 --> 00:58:26.120
People were influenced by the book and committed suicide.

00:58:26.330 --> 00:58:30.460
People in similar circumstances died one after the other.

00:58:30.670 --> 00:58:38.140
In fiction, in books, in words, there resides a power that can kill a person.

00:58:38.340 --> 00:58:40.390
Don't you think it's amazing?

00:58:41.810 --> 00:58:46.520
Am I chasing Miach's ghost?

00:58:46.520 --> 00:58:46.770
Am I chasing Miach's ghost?

00:58:49.230 --> 00:58:49.270
Self-mutilators on a call at the time of the suicide.

00:58:49.280 --> 00:58:52.610
Self-mutilators on a call at the time of the suicide.

00:58:49.810 --> 00:58:52.610
Minutes from Suicide

00:58:53.110 --> 00:58:54.360
[Self-mutilators on a call at the time of suicide event]+[Within 2 minutes]

00:58:55.990 --> 00:58:58.910
Of course she got a call.

00:59:05.790 --> 00:59:10.420
It doesn't take much to imagine who would be on the other end of the line.

00:59:10.630 --> 00:59:14.210
Cian said her name.

00:59:21.930 --> 00:59:25.230
It's been a while. Cian, can you hear me?

00:59:25.430 --> 00:59:29.600
Neither you nor Tuan have come to me.

00:59:29.810 --> 00:59:35.360
Even though you said we'd fight together. I was really sad.

00:59:38.610 --> 00:59:41.490
I'm contacting you today for the first time in thirteen years

00:59:41.700 --> 00:59:44.830
because I want to talk about virtue with you.

00:59:47.620 --> 00:59:50.330
What do you think virtue is?

00:59:50.540 --> 00:59:58.220
Being friendly and helping people in trouble are nothing but little details.

00:59:58.420 --> 01:00:05.470
When you get down to it, virtue is the will to maintain some set of values.

01:00:05.680 --> 01:00:11.020
Ensuring that families continue, happiness continues, peace continues.

01:00:11.230 --> 01:00:15.690
Ensuring that whatever people believe in continues indefinitely.

01:00:15.900 --> 01:00:18.570
That is the essence of virtue.

01:00:19.490 --> 01:00:23.030
But, nothing lasts forever.

01:00:23.240 --> 01:00:29.620
People by nature grow up, grow old, and get sick. And then inevitably they die.

01:00:29.830 --> 01:00:34.090
There is no "good" or "bad" per se in nature or life.

01:00:34.290 --> 01:00:37.010
But you know, it's different now.

01:00:37.210 --> 01:00:40.470
Due to WatchMe, sickness and ordinary old age have been driven out,

01:00:40.680 --> 01:00:46.810
the value called "health" infringes on everything, and those virtues are enveloping the world.

01:00:47.020 --> 01:00:51.810
In the age when kings ruled, they threatened to execute those who opposed them,

01:00:52.020 --> 01:00:55.150
and forced everyone to obey with violence.

01:00:55.360 --> 01:00:57.860
However, after becoming a democracy,

01:00:58.070 --> 01:01:02.030
disciplining oneself by oneself was considered the correct way to live.

01:01:03.530 --> 01:01:10.290
But what should we do when the enemy lies within ourselves?

01:01:10.500 --> 01:01:15.710
"Lifeism" is simultaneously the utmost expression and the utmost corruption of that logic.

01:01:17.550 --> 01:01:21.880
Neither you nor Tuan have come to me.

01:01:27.390 --> 01:01:30.350
Even though you said we'd fight together.

01:01:30.560 --> 01:01:35.020
But if you show me the courage to do it now, that's fine.

01:01:35.230 --> 01:01:40.320
Tell the world that nothing lasts forever.

01:01:40.530 --> 01:01:45.660
Prove here and now that your body belongs to you alone.

01:01:52.660 --> 01:01:56.080
If you do, we can return together to that day.

01:01:56.290 --> 01:02:00.090
That day when we were us.

01:02:06.050 --> 01:02:11.560
Please, show me courage. Show me.

01:02:15.900 --> 01:02:18.650
I'm sorry, Miach.

01:02:36.080 --> 01:02:39.710
This flight, Northern Passengers
Flight 947 departing from Tokyo,

01:02:39.920 --> 01:02:43.260
will soon land in Baghdad Medical City.

01:02:49.680 --> 01:02:52.100
Miach lived...

01:02:52.310 --> 01:02:57.350
She lived... She lived...

01:03:01.940 --> 01:03:06.450
Miach Mihie lived.

01:03:06.650 --> 01:03:11.620
With her proclamation, she is testing the world.

01:03:11.830 --> 01:03:15.710
Kill and live or don't kill and be killed.

01:03:15.910 --> 01:03:21.340
Miach is testing the people of the world.

01:03:29.430 --> 01:03:31.550
Dian Cecht.

01:03:31.760 --> 01:03:33.100
After the cataclysm,

01:03:33.310 --> 01:03:38.020
Baghdad transformed into a huge metropolis for the medical-industrial complex

01:03:38.230 --> 01:03:44.900
because of a preferential tax system and lax laws regarding human experimentation.

01:03:47.400 --> 01:03:50.950
My father is alive in this city.

01:03:51.160 --> 01:03:54.410
And Miach as well.

01:04:01.250 --> 01:04:06.510
When you're in the upper gardens, don't you just completely forget where you are?

01:04:08.720 --> 01:04:12.720
I'm Gabrielle Étaín of the
SEC Neuroscience Consortium.

01:04:12.930 --> 01:04:20.980
I heard that a helix inspector was here and was sure we were under a surprise inspection.

01:04:21.190 --> 01:04:27.740
Well, we don't have a single experiment going on that warrants scrutiny by the WHO.

01:04:27.940 --> 01:04:29.200
I need to ask you:

01:04:29.400 --> 01:04:34.280
Is Dr. Nuada Kirie part of your research team?

01:04:34.490 --> 01:04:38.040
He was, initially.
That was quite a long time ago.

01:04:38.250 --> 01:04:39.870
Where is the doctor now?

01:04:40.080 --> 01:04:41.750
I do not know.

01:04:41.960 --> 01:04:43.580
Really?

01:04:45.090 --> 01:04:47.380
What are you getting at?

01:04:47.590 --> 01:04:51.430
Nuada Kirie is my father.

01:04:51.630 --> 01:04:54.390
Of course I know that.

01:04:54.600 --> 01:04:58.930
So this isn't a warrantless investigation by a helix inspector,

01:04:59.140 --> 01:05:01.810
but your personal search for someone?

01:05:02.020 --> 01:05:04.730
It's merely a request for your cooperation with my investigation.

01:05:04.940 --> 01:05:11.780
Within reason, could you please tell me what kind of research you're doing here?

01:05:11.990 --> 01:05:13.700
Very well.

01:05:13.910 --> 01:05:17.490
Let's say you promised to give someone either ten thousand credits right now,

01:05:17.700 --> 01:05:23.330
or twenty thousand credits after one year. What will they choose?

01:05:23.540 --> 01:05:25.040
The former, I'd suppose.

01:05:25.250 --> 01:05:29.550
That's right, it's a property of desire verified not only in humans

01:05:29.760 --> 01:05:34.090
but also in primates and birds, or even in dogs and cats.

01:05:34.300 --> 01:05:39.060
Some organisms overvalue what's in front of their eyes in the moment.

01:05:39.270 --> 01:05:40.310
Yes.

01:05:40.520 --> 01:05:43.310
That's genetic programming.

01:05:43.520 --> 01:05:46.150
If it doesn't bite the prey that's in front of its eyes,

01:05:46.360 --> 01:05:48.820
then the prey will be snatched up by another individual,

01:05:49.030 --> 01:05:50.740
and thus the first individual,

01:05:50.940 --> 01:05:54.360
waiting stubbornly and hoping for a future profit, cannot survive.

01:05:54.570 --> 01:05:58.240
A game of survival where small short-term desires

01:05:58.450 --> 01:06:02.000
and big long-term desires fight one another to be chosen.

01:06:02.200 --> 01:06:05.630
This is the true nature of what we call "will."

01:06:05.830 --> 01:06:09.670
Even pain is chosen by will.

01:06:09.880 --> 01:06:10.920
Pain?

01:06:11.130 --> 01:06:16.140
Yes... Even the pain you feel the moment you prick your finger on a needle

01:06:16.340 --> 01:06:21.560
is only felt after being selected in your brain and making an impression on your mind.

01:06:21.770 --> 01:06:23.100
I'm sure you've heard stories

01:06:23.310 --> 01:06:28.230
of people not noticing that they've lost a finger in an accident until later,

01:06:28.440 --> 01:06:31.150
because they were concentrating on something else.

01:06:31.360 --> 01:06:36.110
It's that at that time, the pain lost out to the conscious interest occupying their mind

01:06:36.320 --> 01:06:40.080
and didn't enter their consciousness.

01:06:40.280 --> 01:06:44.160
That means all the sensations that shape our reality

01:06:44.370 --> 01:06:49.840
are an aggregate of things brought up and chosen by the brain's higher levels.

01:06:50.040 --> 01:06:55.220
Naturally, helix inspectors pick up on things quickly.

01:06:55.420 --> 01:06:58.840
I would like you to answer as an expert.

01:06:59.050 --> 01:07:04.680
Is it possible for the criminals to induce suicide in the way they claimed?

01:07:04.890 --> 01:07:06.810
Who knows?

01:07:07.020 --> 01:07:13.570
We, at least, unfortunately have not reached the point of controlling a person at will

01:07:13.780 --> 01:07:16.650
or showing them a reality as we please.

01:07:17.820 --> 01:07:24.540
What will you do? Until the deadline given by the criminals comes?

01:07:26.710 --> 01:07:27.960
Nothing.

01:07:28.170 --> 01:07:31.040
It's a mere empty threat.

01:07:31.250 --> 01:07:33.630
Now, will that be all?

01:07:33.840 --> 01:07:35.720
Just one more thing.

01:07:35.920 --> 01:07:43.510
Do you know of a research group called the
Next Gen Human Behavior Working Group?

01:07:43.720 --> 01:07:45.140
No.

01:07:50.060 --> 01:07:52.860
Head towards the hotel. I'll check in.

01:07:53.070 --> 01:07:57.780
Your room is being prepared at the
Baghdad Hotel on Saadoun Street.

01:08:00.450 --> 01:08:02.910
We've connected to Senior Inspector Kirie.

01:08:03.120 --> 01:08:06.370
Request immediate aug meeting participation!

01:08:06.580 --> 01:08:09.790
How many homicide cases appear to be related to the "proclamation"?

01:08:10.000 --> 01:08:14.840
Ma'am! We can't say definitively yet, but clearly the numbers are increasing!

01:08:15.050 --> 01:08:17.090
Admedistrations are making emergency broadcasts

01:08:17.300 --> 01:08:20.010
trying to calm the panic the proclamation caused.

01:08:20.220 --> 01:08:22.760
But we don't know how much they can suppress it!

01:08:22.970 --> 01:08:25.180
What about suicides?

01:08:25.390 --> 01:08:29.560
A new report just came from the Japanese police!

01:08:29.770 --> 01:08:31.650
It has now surpassed three hundred people!

01:08:31.850 --> 01:08:34.520
Here, a suicide note was left behind!

01:08:35.690 --> 01:08:37.530
Suicide notes are still increasing.

01:08:37.740 --> 01:08:41.410
Two incidents in Cologne, Germany, one incident in Sartre, Spain!

01:08:41.610 --> 01:08:42.700
It's spreading.

01:08:42.910 --> 01:08:44.280
Summarize the contents of the notes.

01:08:44.490 --> 01:08:51.750
"I can't kill anyone. Even if I could, afterward
I likely could not live with the remorse."

01:08:51.960 --> 01:08:56.630
"My body certainly is a public resource, but so is everyone else's."

01:08:56.840 --> 01:09:01.380
"I cannot find a way to resolve this dilemma other than committing suicide."

01:09:01.590 --> 01:09:08.430
Apologies to wives, daughters, and neighbors for choosing the path of suicide.

01:09:08.640 --> 01:09:11.980
This is not the work of whoever's behind the proclamation.

01:09:12.190 --> 01:09:13.650
It's a foreseeable situation:

01:09:13.850 --> 01:09:16.570
people taking their own lives because they cannot answer the question

01:09:16.770 --> 01:09:18.230
of whether to kill or be killed.

01:09:18.440 --> 01:09:19.440
Any media restrictions?

01:09:19.650 --> 01:09:22.910
Other than the family, the only ones who know are the local police and Interpol,

01:09:23.110 --> 01:09:25.450
and now the helix inspectors!

01:09:25.660 --> 01:09:27.410
If the contents of these notes are leaked,

01:09:27.620 --> 01:09:29.620
more people are likely to follow in their stead.

01:09:29.830 --> 01:09:31.830
Instate the highest level of media restrictions!

01:09:32.040 --> 01:09:35.380
Nonetheless, we'll be able to hold this back for several days at most...

01:09:35.580 --> 01:09:40.420
Or, there's also the possibility that chaos itself is the goal of the criminals.

01:09:42.090 --> 01:09:44.220
The Werther effect...

01:09:44.430 --> 01:09:48.470
We can't forcibly cut off the link between
WatchMe and the health management servers?

01:09:48.680 --> 01:09:50.560
They are directly connected to lifelines!

01:09:50.770 --> 01:09:52.480
All hell will break loose.

01:09:52.690 --> 01:09:55.940
There's no telling how many lives would be lost!

01:10:04.150 --> 01:10:05.740
Tuan Kirie!

01:10:18.000 --> 01:10:21.880
Evening

01:10:18.000 --> 01:10:21.880
Abu Nuwas.

01:10:18.000 --> 01:10:21.880
No Augs.

01:10:24.090 --> 01:10:26.010
Abu Nuwas.

01:10:26.220 --> 01:10:28.350
Outside the Admedistration.

01:10:37.690 --> 01:10:39.940
According to information

01:10:37.690 --> 01:10:39.940
from various countries,

01:10:40.150 --> 01:10:42.570
governmental agencies around the world

01:10:42.780 --> 01:10:47.780
are collaborating to calm the chaos

01:10:42.780 --> 01:10:47.780
that is spreading globally.

01:10:47.990 --> 01:10:49.070
We have new information.

01:10:49.280 --> 01:10:52.750
It appears that both Canada and Italy have requested the deployment

01:10:52.950 --> 01:10:55.330
of Geneva Convention troops.

01:11:13.100 --> 01:11:15.140
Are you going out into the old city?

01:11:15.350 --> 01:11:17.850
WatchMe functions somewhat even outside,

01:11:18.060 --> 01:11:20.270
but the Admedistration makes absolutely no guarantees.

01:11:20.480 --> 01:11:21.400
Is this acceptable?

01:11:21.610 --> 01:11:22.690
Yes.

01:11:22.900 --> 01:11:25.740
Then please authenticate this affidavit.

01:11:37.540 --> 01:11:42.540
Even in this moment, WatchMe is probably issuing a nagging warning to my augs

01:11:42.750 --> 01:11:46.380
about ingredients and calories.

01:11:46.590 --> 01:11:50.050
A life outside of the Admedistration that doesn't use augs.

01:11:50.260 --> 01:11:53.260
Even a stone's throw away from the center of the medical world,

01:11:53.470 --> 01:11:57.640
there are still people who don't relinquish their bodies to someone else's control.

01:11:57.850 --> 01:12:02.940
They never install WatchMe and are never connected to the servers.

01:12:03.150 --> 01:12:10.610
They catch colds, feel headaches, get cancer, and die around 60 or 70.

01:12:10.820 --> 01:12:13.120
It's the antithesis of life inside the gates,

01:12:13.330 --> 01:12:18.290
where the proclamation caused so many to hole up in their homes.

01:12:18.500 --> 01:12:24.460
People in here probably never listened to that news in the first place.

01:12:35.110 --> 01:12:36.470
Go to   the river.

01:13:15.680 --> 01:13:19.430
Do you know why they call this area Mesopotamia?

01:13:19.640 --> 01:13:22.640
I can't forget this voice.

01:13:22.850 --> 01:13:26.020
It means "between two rivers."

01:13:26.230 --> 01:13:29.070
The Tigris and the Euphrates.

01:13:29.280 --> 01:13:32.400
At some point I landed in the in-between, too.

01:13:35.370 --> 01:13:36.910
It's good you came.

01:13:37.120 --> 01:13:39.330
Ah... that wound...

01:13:39.540 --> 01:13:42.750
Oh, it's due to an experiment. I overdid it.

01:13:42.960 --> 01:13:44.500
Dad...

01:13:44.710 --> 01:13:49.050
How many years has it been since I last saw you?

01:13:49.250 --> 01:13:53.260
My good-for-nothing father who left me and my mother behind thirteen years ago.

01:13:53.470 --> 01:13:55.220
Nuada Kirie.

01:13:55.430 --> 01:13:58.850
This was all too like him.

01:13:59.060 --> 01:14:01.600
Many people are dying.

01:14:01.810 --> 01:14:03.600
Yes... It's unfortunate.

01:14:03.810 --> 01:14:09.440
"Unfortunate"?! Wasn't it your doing?
You used Miach!

01:14:11.740 --> 01:14:15.200
Miach was your friend, wasn't she?

01:14:26.750 --> 01:14:29.210
Why was it Miach?

01:14:29.420 --> 01:14:34.380
I assume you know that the number of childhood suicides was increasing every year at the time.

01:14:34.590 --> 01:14:39.140
Tuan, you and Miach attempted it, too.

01:14:39.350 --> 01:14:41.600
A while after the introduction of WatchMe,

01:14:41.810 --> 01:14:45.640
self harm among children began to rise.

01:14:45.850 --> 01:14:48.270
Admedistrations mulled over the problem,

01:14:48.480 --> 01:14:52.320
took custody of such children, and began treatment.

01:14:52.530 --> 01:14:54.280
You probably already know.

01:14:54.490 --> 01:14:59.370
This was the organization called the
Next Gen Human Behavior Working Group.

01:14:59.580 --> 01:15:03.000
The treatment was also an experiment.

01:15:03.200 --> 01:15:07.170
It was a test to verify the limits of the Harmony Program.

01:15:07.370 --> 01:15:11.090
Miach was there.

01:15:15.670 --> 01:15:17.430
Harmony Program?

01:15:17.630 --> 01:15:21.390
Harmony... in short, a system and technology

01:15:21.600 --> 01:15:26.390
to program the brains of humans to have harmonious wills.

01:15:26.600 --> 01:15:31.190
A promising method to save the will of humans from barbarism.

01:15:31.400 --> 01:15:36.320
That was the organization's goal and my research.

01:15:36.530 --> 01:15:39.360
I had researched under
Professor Saeki matters such as

01:15:39.570 --> 01:15:43.620
human choice and determination, feelings and thoughts.

01:15:43.830 --> 01:15:46.790
Controlling a person's will was an extremely important agenda

01:15:47.000 --> 01:15:52.590
for certain top officials in the
Admedistrations and the WHO.

01:15:54.460 --> 01:15:56.260
And Miach...

01:15:56.470 --> 01:16:02.680
Her will had been pierced by the even deeper despair and rebellion of her soul.

01:16:02.890 --> 01:16:09.020
If we could master her brain, her iron will to charge towards her death,

01:16:09.230 --> 01:16:12.810
then we could control anyone's will.

01:16:16.320 --> 01:16:19.570
I can't deny it was simplistic of us, but that's what we thought.

01:16:19.780 --> 01:16:23.530
Well, come in, this is my in-betweener's hideout.

01:16:28.210 --> 01:16:30.920
I assume you don't mind caffeine.

01:16:37.170 --> 01:16:39.800
Is this where you research?

01:16:40.010 --> 01:16:45.010
I can't do it here.
Until a little while ago I was in Dian Cecht.

01:16:45.220 --> 01:16:47.600
Miach was there too, right?

01:16:49.560 --> 01:16:50.890
There's a side effect.

01:16:51.100 --> 01:16:52.520
Huh?

01:16:53.690 --> 01:16:57.780
The Harmony Program had a serious side effect.

01:16:57.990 --> 01:17:03.570
If analyzed logically, it ought to have been predictable.

01:17:03.780 --> 01:17:07.200
The harmony of will, harmonics.

01:17:07.410 --> 01:17:14.500
We pursued it relentlessly, and were rewarded with perfect stability of the brain's desires.

01:17:14.710 --> 01:17:20.130
However... it obliterated consciousness.

01:17:20.340 --> 01:17:24.260
We learned of the dissolution of consciousness through our experiments on Miach.

01:17:24.470 --> 01:17:27.260
That is the Harmony Program's side effect.

01:17:27.470 --> 01:17:29.310
What happens when consciousness disappears?!

01:17:29.520 --> 01:17:34.190
What happened to Miach?!
Did she end up in a vegetative state?!

01:17:34.400 --> 01:17:38.530
No. How should I put this?

01:17:38.730 --> 01:17:45.910
Shopping, food, entertainment, all of these are axiomatically chosen. <i>Axiomatically.</i>

01:17:49.410 --> 01:17:54.290
There's no need for choice and conflict.

01:17:54.500 --> 01:17:58.420
Outwardly, it's impossible to distinguish between someone who has consciousness

01:17:58.630 --> 01:18:01.760
and someone who merely behaves as though they do.

01:18:03.800 --> 01:18:05.840
And Miach?

01:18:06.050 --> 01:18:09.600
She said that it was ecstasy.

01:18:09.810 --> 01:18:18.570
She ate normally, studied, chatted with us, and led a normal life.

01:18:18.770 --> 01:18:21.360
When we ended the experiment and gave her consciousness back,

01:18:21.570 --> 01:18:24.860
she said that she didn't remember anything.

01:18:26.410 --> 01:18:31.620
She said that she'd experienced only the ecstasy of being enveloped

01:18:31.830 --> 01:18:35.000
by a vaguely blissful world.

01:18:37.670 --> 01:18:40.460
By some definitions, it's the same state as death.

01:18:40.670 --> 01:18:45.340
We turned to the higher-ups at the WHO and the Admedistration for a decision.

01:18:45.550 --> 01:18:48.640
Consequently, using WatchMe,

01:18:48.850 --> 01:18:53.310
we programmed this system into the humans living in all Admedistrational zones.

01:18:53.520 --> 01:18:57.310
Into my brain as well as into yours.

01:18:57.520 --> 01:19:05.200
It's a compromise: although it's installed in the brain, it's not activated.

01:19:05.400 --> 01:19:09.780
If chaos like The Maelstrom were to rear its head again,

01:19:09.990 --> 01:19:12.910
we could erase consciousness at any time.

01:19:13.120 --> 01:19:14.960
No...

01:19:15.160 --> 01:19:18.420
The higher-ups at the moment don't have any intention of doing it.

01:19:18.630 --> 01:19:23.050
They don't wish for a state that disavows humanity.

01:19:23.260 --> 01:19:26.050
However, people who do wish for that have appeared.

01:19:26.260 --> 01:19:29.800
The organization is internally divided.

01:19:30.010 --> 01:19:33.770
Miach Mihie wants to do that.

01:19:40.480 --> 01:19:45.240
The reason I called you here was her.

01:19:45.440 --> 01:19:50.030
Selfish. You were always that way.

01:19:50.240 --> 01:19:52.580
Including when you threw us away.

01:19:56.200 --> 01:19:59.170
I am being targeted by a dissident group.

01:19:59.370 --> 01:20:02.040
Leave this city quickly.

01:20:02.250 --> 01:20:07.220
You are the only one who can meet Miach now, Tuan.

01:20:07.420 --> 01:20:09.840
<i>You</i> can stop her!

01:20:10.050 --> 01:20:14.810
Impossible! What could I do at this point?!

01:20:15.020 --> 01:20:17.180
Tuan...

01:20:19.980 --> 01:20:21.400
Dad!

01:20:22.440 --> 01:20:24.650
Are you okay? Dad?

01:20:24.860 --> 01:20:27.940
I'm with Interpol, Mr. Nuada Kirie.

01:20:28.150 --> 01:20:29.740
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

01:20:29.950 --> 01:20:34.240
I'm placing you under arrest as the one responsible for the mass suicide.

01:20:34.450 --> 01:20:37.660
Hey now, Tuan, you don't move either.

01:20:37.870 --> 01:20:40.670
Since you're a relative of this criminal, aren't you?

01:20:40.870 --> 01:20:45.630
Vashlov, I take it you're a member of Miach's group.

01:20:45.840 --> 01:20:49.880
Leave it to a helix inspector.
What an interesting deduction.

01:20:50.090 --> 01:20:54.800
You anticipated that if I, a helix inspector, began investigating,

01:20:55.010 --> 01:20:58.390
my father Nuada Kirie would eventually contact me.

01:20:58.600 --> 01:21:04.150
You wanted to drag
Nuada Kirie out from hiding.

01:21:04.360 --> 01:21:07.400
If I can secure Mr. Nuada, that's all I care about.

01:21:07.610 --> 01:21:09.860
What will you do then?

01:21:10.900 --> 01:21:13.660
Nuada Kirie is the leader of the establishment.

01:21:13.870 --> 01:21:18.450
By taking him into custody, I take away what holds them together and gives them cohesion.

01:21:18.660 --> 01:21:21.540
The situation can then proceed in the direction we want--

01:21:21.750 --> 01:21:26.130
I hate to disappoint you, but I don't have much power these days.

01:21:26.340 --> 01:21:28.760
Your excuses won't work.

01:21:28.960 --> 01:21:34.140
You are also the mastermind that came up with the future that we desire.

01:21:34.340 --> 01:21:36.470
And what future do you all desire?

01:21:36.680 --> 01:21:39.720
The future that we desire is--

01:21:40.600 --> 01:21:41.560
Dad, this way!

01:21:41.770 --> 01:21:43.190
Shit!

01:22:15.180 --> 01:22:15.970
Dad!

01:22:16.180 --> 01:22:17.760
It's a flesh wound!

01:22:30.190 --> 01:22:31.610
Tuan!

01:22:42.540 --> 01:22:43.960
Dad!

01:22:45.920 --> 01:22:49.960
I was told not to kill him if possible, but...

01:23:02.520 --> 01:23:07.940
Finally, I could be something of a father...

01:23:13.440 --> 01:23:21.120
N-Now... the establishment has lost an ideologue...

01:23:21.330 --> 01:23:26.040
And now... chaos... will engulf the world...

01:23:26.250 --> 01:23:30.790
Suicide... intimidation... are nothing more than...

01:23:31.000 --> 01:23:35.970
...catalysts... to give birth to... complete chaos...

01:23:39.090 --> 01:23:41.350
Where is Miach?

01:23:41.550 --> 01:23:45.980
We bring... a new world...

01:23:46.180 --> 01:23:53.530
We will bring a new harmony that transcends chaos... into this world.

01:23:53.730 --> 01:24:01.240
The guide to peace... that...
Miach Mihie provided us...

01:24:01.450 --> 01:24:06.370
Sh-She... is gazing far... into the future...

01:24:07.580 --> 01:24:16.590
Chechnya. Contact Chechnya's...
Anti-Russian... Freedom Front...

01:24:16.800 --> 01:24:18.880
She is there.

01:24:19.090 --> 01:24:24.180
I was told that it's okay to tell... you...

01:24:24.390 --> 01:24:27.520
P-Please... kill me...

01:24:27.730 --> 01:24:34.400
Ah... it hurts... this is what... pain is...

01:24:34.610 --> 01:24:42.820
Because of WatchMe... and MediCare... I had forgotten... pain...

01:24:43.030 --> 01:24:47.450
Kill... me...

01:25:06.430 --> 01:25:13.770
Today, the very act of living is controlled by WatchMe, by the powers that be.

01:25:13.980 --> 01:25:21.360
But, "death is power's limit, the moment that escapes it."

01:25:21.570 --> 01:25:27.790
"Death becomes the most secret aspect of existence, the most 'private.'"

01:25:27.990 --> 01:25:30.120
Whose words are those?

01:25:30.330 --> 01:25:32.370
Michel Foucault.

01:25:39.130 --> 01:25:43.680
I wonder if that's the only way to get out of here after all.

01:25:43.890 --> 01:25:48.260
Before I came here, I was forced to obey a different authority than this one.

01:25:48.470 --> 01:25:51.100
That place was hell.

01:25:51.310 --> 01:25:56.400
But I learned this place was plenty crazy, too.
Just as crazy as the other side.

01:25:56.610 --> 01:25:58.570
The other side?

01:26:00.360 --> 01:26:02.740
The exact opposite place.

01:26:02.950 --> 01:26:06.990
If you're on the other side, you'll be killed by a gun.

01:26:07.200 --> 01:26:12.870
If you're on this side, you'll be killed by kindness.

01:26:13.080 --> 01:26:18.920
I know about the dark desires she's had since childhood.

01:26:19.130 --> 01:26:25.430
We created so many curses, huddled together over a desk...

01:26:25.640 --> 01:26:32.180
Does Miach even now continue to harbor the hatred she had back then?

01:26:33.480 --> 01:26:39.520
Did she at last gain the power to crush the world and put it to use?

01:28:16.330 --> 01:28:20.830
The day after tomorrow is the proclaimed deadline for killing one person.

01:28:21.040 --> 01:28:23.130
Many are overwhelmed by their terror of it,

01:28:23.340 --> 01:28:25.960
and death and madness shroud the world.

01:28:26.170 --> 01:28:29.510
Not only murders, but also many suicides and double suicides are occurring.

01:28:29.720 --> 01:28:33.260
Violence is breaking out in every part of the world.

01:28:33.470 --> 01:28:38.520
There are still no reports of murders or suicides committed by the police and military.

01:28:38.730 --> 01:28:42.560
But I won't be surprised when it happens.

01:28:42.770 --> 01:28:46.650
Even if it occurs among us helix inspectors?

01:28:46.860 --> 01:28:50.820
You should be fine, since you've already killed one person.

01:28:51.030 --> 01:28:52.370
It was self-defense.

01:28:52.570 --> 01:28:55.080
I doubt you feel much guilt, either.

01:28:55.280 --> 01:28:57.250
My father was killed.

01:28:57.450 --> 01:29:00.460
That man was affiliated with Interpol,

01:29:00.670 --> 01:29:04.460
yet he used its authority for another organization's purposes.

01:29:04.670 --> 01:29:11.090
The name of that organization is the
Next Gen Human Behavior Working Group.

01:29:11.300 --> 01:29:13.590
They formed soon after the end of the cataclysm,

01:29:13.800 --> 01:29:18.140
and their goal is to prevent such global pandemonium from ever recurring.

01:29:18.350 --> 01:29:21.190
In other words, to prevent a catastrophe.

01:29:21.390 --> 01:29:26.320
For that, it seems the approach of neuromedical research was adopted.

01:29:26.520 --> 01:29:30.650
Gabrielle Étaín is in a neuromedical research consortium.

01:29:30.860 --> 01:29:34.620
Are you sure she isn't part of the organization?

01:29:34.820 --> 01:29:37.660
She was killed. Three hours ago.

01:29:38.410 --> 01:29:41.710
In the report it's a random street killing.

01:29:41.910 --> 01:29:46.960
But it may have been a targeted hit using the current chaos as cover.

01:29:47.170 --> 01:29:48.630
Where are you?

01:29:48.840 --> 01:29:50.340
I'm on my way to Chechnya.

01:29:50.550 --> 01:29:51.420
Why?

01:29:51.630 --> 01:29:53.970
I can't say anything more than that.

01:29:55.890 --> 01:29:58.850
They're split in two factions and the rift is deepening.

01:29:59.060 --> 01:30:02.520
It's highly probable that these factions have infiltrated

01:30:02.730 --> 01:30:06.150
not only the helix inspectors, but even the highest ranks of the WHO.

01:30:10.530 --> 01:30:12.780
It's a call on a special line.

01:30:12.990 --> 01:30:16.620
Everyone except Senior Inspector Kirie, please leave.

01:30:34.680 --> 01:30:39.510
It's as if we are looking at the return of the cataclysm from half a century ago.

01:30:39.720 --> 01:30:44.520
Is humanity destined to plunge into violence like this?

01:30:44.730 --> 01:30:48.860
Despite all the preparations we made to avoid this situation...

01:30:50.230 --> 01:30:52.360
You all are...

01:30:52.570 --> 01:30:55.360
The people, police, and the Admedistration...

01:30:55.570 --> 01:30:59.030
Who knew a society that has followed an extremely peaceful way of life

01:30:59.240 --> 01:31:01.700
could be so very vulnerable...

01:31:01.910 --> 01:31:05.710
And the enemy has exploited that vulnerability.

01:31:05.920 --> 01:31:13.420
We are the top members of the
Next Gen Human Behavior Working Group.

01:31:14.920 --> 01:31:16.760
That means you're...

01:31:16.970 --> 01:31:23.720
Your father's comrades.
What happened to him was regrettable. Truly.

01:31:24.390 --> 01:31:30.230
After they betrayed the organization, they persistently targeted Nuada.

01:31:30.440 --> 01:31:33.440
Both I and my father were being monitored.

01:31:33.650 --> 01:31:37.200
I had hoped that either
Miach Mihie's group would contact you,

01:31:37.410 --> 01:31:43.830
or that in the process of your investigation you would establish contact.

01:31:44.040 --> 01:31:47.420
That would explain why you didn't sweat giving me those five days.

01:31:47.620 --> 01:31:51.290
They stole access privileges to part of the Harmony Program

01:31:51.500 --> 01:31:55.920
we sealed away and went into hiding.

01:31:56.970 --> 01:32:00.640
They are misleading the people of less than ten percent of all governments

01:32:00.850 --> 01:32:04.520
to spread death and fear across the world.

01:32:04.720 --> 01:32:08.730
What is Miach Mihie ultimately trying to do?

01:32:08.940 --> 01:32:12.520
Why does she want to cause chaos in this healthy Lifeist society?

01:32:12.730 --> 01:32:15.780
Why does she want to activate the Harmony Program?

01:32:15.990 --> 01:32:18.320
We don't understand.

01:32:19.530 --> 01:32:26.000
You can draw out her reasoning and stop her, Senior Inspector Kirie.

01:32:31.000 --> 01:32:32.630
Is something funny?

01:32:32.840 --> 01:32:37.130
No, you're just saying the same things as my father.

01:32:37.340 --> 01:32:39.430
Well, goodbye.

01:32:39.630 --> 01:32:42.470
Senior Inspector Kirie!

01:32:43.760 --> 01:32:48.060
The world might be resting on your shoulders.

01:32:48.270 --> 01:32:51.730
Do you really think that?

01:32:51.940 --> 01:32:56.400
I want to hear your real thoughts, Tuan.

01:32:56.610 --> 01:33:00.360
I don't particularly give a shit about the world.

01:33:00.570 --> 01:33:04.950
Meeting Miach Mihie, who killed Cian and possibly my father,

01:33:05.160 --> 01:33:08.330
and getting some sort of closure...

01:33:08.540 --> 01:33:12.960
That is the basis on which I act.

01:33:13.830 --> 01:33:16.170
K-Kirie!

01:33:24.100 --> 01:33:26.390
Humankind is being asked:

01:33:26.600 --> 01:33:30.640
will you aim for happiness or will you aim for truth?

01:33:32.520 --> 01:33:38.400
If the world can't stop this chaos on its own,

01:33:38.610 --> 01:33:42.450
then there will be no other choice but to activate the Harmony Program

01:33:42.660 --> 01:33:46.240
that we sealed away.

01:33:59.090 --> 01:34:00.840
Show this to your boss.

01:34:01.050 --> 01:34:03.260
She'll understand.

01:34:07.260 --> 01:34:10.350
A soldier from the Anti-Russian Freedom Front.

01:34:10.560 --> 01:34:15.690
I arranged what you asked for, Tuan.
He's also been equipped.

01:34:16.770 --> 01:34:19.150
Thank you, Uwe.

01:34:26.950 --> 01:34:34.620
What Miach sought was a world where your body is your own.

01:34:34.830 --> 01:34:37.210
A world in which you can feel your body belongs to you,

01:34:37.420 --> 01:34:39.550
rather than to society or a set of norms.

01:34:39.750 --> 01:34:47.140
Could that same Miach really want a world where one ceases to be oneself?

01:34:51.520 --> 01:34:55.690
Coordinates... "Alone"...

01:34:56.650 --> 01:35:03.940
It's okay Miach.
I've been alone ever since that day.

01:35:14.250 --> 01:35:20.130
Chechnya... The place where
Miach Mihie was born.

01:35:20.340 --> 01:35:25.220
The place where her consciousness was born.

01:35:25.420 --> 01:35:28.800
Several decades ago, an ethnic minority was found

01:35:29.010 --> 01:35:32.010
amidst the conflict between Russia and Chechnya.

01:35:32.220 --> 01:35:36.600
They were a new people that until then had never appeared in human history.

01:35:36.810 --> 01:35:39.150
Never mingling with other ethnic groups,

01:35:39.360 --> 01:35:46.110
they formed an isolated community in the craggy mountains, and repeatedly inbred.

01:35:46.320 --> 01:35:49.030
That was Miach's birthplace.

01:35:49.240 --> 01:35:52.240
These people had a certain recessive trait.

01:35:52.450 --> 01:35:54.500
We on the rare occasion also have these genes,

01:35:54.700 --> 01:35:57.080
but because there are rarely marriages between people with them,

01:35:57.290 --> 01:36:00.540
the trait is almost never observed.

01:36:00.750 --> 01:36:05.090
This trait is a lack of genes that generate consciousness.

01:36:05.300 --> 01:36:09.890
Almost none of those people had what could be called consciousness.

01:36:10.090 --> 01:36:14.640
The same state as the
Harmony Program's side effect.

01:36:14.850 --> 01:36:19.770
Apparently they had the ability to make truly rational decisions.

01:36:19.980 --> 01:36:23.110
They acted axiomatically, without making choices...

01:36:23.320 --> 01:36:28.070
In other words, they were a people that had no consciousness nor need for consciousness.

01:36:28.280 --> 01:36:32.490
They were a group that innately maintained harmony.

01:36:32.700 --> 01:36:35.330
But, why would Miach...?

01:36:35.540 --> 01:36:39.710
When she was eight years old, she was kidnapped by the Russian army.

01:36:39.920 --> 01:36:43.630
I heard she was sent to a camp for human trafficking.

01:36:43.840 --> 01:36:48.420
There, I think she experienced unimaginable misery.

01:36:48.630 --> 01:36:52.300
She didn't tell me much, but...

01:36:52.510 --> 01:36:56.310
She said that her consciousness woke up there.

01:36:56.520 --> 01:36:58.390
Woke up?

01:36:58.600 --> 01:37:02.100
A hatred-based consciousness was born in Miach, who previously had none,

01:37:02.310 --> 01:37:05.270
through the constant threat of fear and pain.

01:37:05.480 --> 01:37:09.610
No, I should call it something akin to consciousness.

01:37:09.820 --> 01:37:12.620
Other areas of the limbic system emulated

01:37:12.820 --> 01:37:17.830
what should have been handled by the nuclei and lateral ventricles.

01:37:18.040 --> 01:37:21.080
An emulation of consciousness...

01:37:21.290 --> 01:37:24.130
An imitation of consciousness...

01:37:25.000 --> 01:37:28.630
An imitation of a soul...

01:37:28.840 --> 01:37:31.090
I will burn it all.

01:37:31.300 --> 01:37:35.800
Because if I don't burn it for them, these children will bind me to the earth,

01:37:36.010 --> 01:37:38.390
and I will not be able to pass on to the other side.

01:37:38.600 --> 01:37:41.390
So the pills are ready.

01:37:41.600 --> 01:37:43.020
Yeah.

01:37:43.400 --> 01:37:49.360
In China, when the emperor changed, they burned all of the history scrolls.

01:37:49.570 --> 01:37:52.740
In order to be able to write a new history.

01:37:54.030 --> 01:37:57.030
Why do you think people write things down?

01:37:57.240 --> 01:37:58.620
Why?

01:37:58.830 --> 01:38:00.290
Because the words will remain.

01:38:00.500 --> 01:38:03.210
Nearly forever.

01:38:04.920 --> 01:38:09.550
The Bible was like that.
The pyramids were too in a way.

01:38:09.760 --> 01:38:14.260
Since long ago, people have been obsessed with eternity.

01:38:17.010 --> 01:38:19.350
Could you, please?

01:38:19.560 --> 01:38:21.930
It's too painful for me.

01:38:22.140 --> 01:38:25.520
These books are your alter egos.

01:38:36.280 --> 01:38:42.370
They say that long ago
Japan burned bodies like this.

01:38:44.250 --> 01:38:46.330
It was called "cremation."

01:38:46.540 --> 01:38:50.880
The objects that the deceased loved were placed inside the coffin.

01:38:59.180 --> 01:39:02.980
This is my cremation.

01:39:03.180 --> 01:39:08.400
I will take the things that gave me power with me.

01:39:17.410 --> 01:39:24.910
I want to launch a surprise attack on what people think is eternal.

01:39:25.120 --> 01:39:29.630
I want to deal a blow to this time that has stopped.

01:39:31.090 --> 01:39:35.260
Our three deaths will be that blow...

01:39:45.850 --> 01:39:49.980
Areas that humans at one time regarded as natural

01:39:50.190 --> 01:39:54.440
have decreased the more human history drags on.

01:39:54.650 --> 01:39:59.490
What is the basis for saying we must not tamper with the soul

01:39:59.700 --> 01:40:02.030
or with human consciousness?

01:40:02.240 --> 01:40:06.910
Where are the words that will defend the soul?

01:40:21.510 --> 01:40:23.510
From here on is private.

01:40:23.720 --> 01:40:25.770
Stay here.

01:40:29.400 --> 01:40:31.940
I've come, Miach.

01:41:33.500 --> 01:41:35.590
Tuan, it's been a long time.

01:41:35.790 --> 01:41:38.090
Thirteen years, right?

01:41:41.090 --> 01:41:44.180
You don't need a gun or anything.

01:41:44.390 --> 01:41:48.140
It's just the two of us here.

01:41:52.390 --> 01:41:55.520
I was sure you'd come.

01:41:55.730 --> 01:41:59.610
I thought, "Tuan will be the only one to come here."

01:42:22.840 --> 01:42:25.010
I'm here, Tuan!

01:42:40.610 --> 01:42:42.820
You grew your hair out.

01:42:43.030 --> 01:42:45.110
It suits you.

01:42:50.620 --> 01:42:54.410
I regret what happened to your father.

01:42:54.620 --> 01:42:58.090
I'll bet you'll say there was no other choice, though.

01:42:58.290 --> 01:43:02.050
Yes, I will. There was no other choice.

01:43:13.810 --> 01:43:16.520
To me there was another choice.

01:43:16.730 --> 01:43:19.690
I wish no one had died.

01:43:19.900 --> 01:43:21.360
True.

01:43:21.570 --> 01:43:26.200
Murders, suicides--there's nonstop violence all over the world now!

01:43:26.410 --> 01:43:32.240
Because otherwise, the elders wouldn't push the button.

01:43:33.250 --> 01:43:37.920
What we want is the harmonics of the human race.

01:43:39.750 --> 01:43:42.960
This time, I really will die.

01:43:43.170 --> 01:43:45.380
What about you?

01:43:48.390 --> 01:43:51.100
A brave new world.

01:43:51.310 --> 01:43:53.680
A new world, you say?

01:43:54.470 --> 01:43:59.980
Tuan, my consciousness was born here.

01:44:05.570 --> 01:44:08.070
I heard that from my father.

01:44:09.450 --> 01:44:10.870
I see.

01:44:13.410 --> 01:44:17.580
This was the Russian army's base for prostitution.

01:44:17.790 --> 01:44:25.880
Girls abducted on the battlefield were raped every single day by the Russian soldiers.

01:44:26.090 --> 01:44:28.680
I was one of them.

01:44:28.880 --> 01:44:34.930
At that time, I didn't yet have the consciousness to feel pain and fear like I do now.

01:44:36.430 --> 01:44:43.020
While an officer was on top of me, entering me over and over,

01:44:43.230 --> 01:44:47.320
I was made to touch the tip of a vintage Tokarev.

01:44:48.200 --> 01:44:54.660
"This is a gun. This is steel.
This is power," he said,

01:44:54.870 --> 01:44:58.910
as he shoved the muzzle into my mouth.

01:44:59.120 --> 01:45:03.590
He did it over and over.

01:45:07.800 --> 01:45:16.220
I was thrust into over and over, and when my drool had coated the gun...

01:45:16.430 --> 01:45:19.690
...my consciousness was born.

01:45:23.110 --> 01:45:32.450
This concrete is stained with semen, women's juices, blood, tears, snot, and sweat...

01:45:32.660 --> 01:45:35.740
...everything.

01:45:35.950 --> 01:45:41.620
Among it all I was born again.
As a human with consciousness.

01:45:41.830 --> 01:45:49.340
Miach, just... stop... stop...

01:45:58.720 --> 01:46:04.270
Here, I learned how savage humans could become.

01:46:04.480 --> 01:46:07.190
But, Japan is the inverse of here.

01:46:07.400 --> 01:46:13.490
The opposite hell, where kindness kills.

01:46:13.700 --> 01:46:19.200
When I was twelve, a boy that lived next to me hanged himself and died.

01:46:19.410 --> 01:46:21.660
He died saying that he hated this world,

01:46:21.870 --> 01:46:27.500
that he didn't have anywhere he belonged in this world.

01:46:37.930 --> 01:46:40.060
You understand, right Tuan?

01:46:40.270 --> 01:46:46.100
Being a young soul trembling with fear, saying you have no place to belong.

01:46:56.780 --> 01:47:05.080
Didn't you stir up chaos to get revenge on that world?

01:47:05.290 --> 01:47:10.420
No, that's not it.
Now I love this world with all my heart.

01:47:10.630 --> 01:47:14.090
The souls who can't find their place, those tortured by self-consciousness,

01:47:14.300 --> 01:47:19.470
those with patchwork consciousness--
I will take all of them to perfect harmony.

01:47:24.730 --> 01:47:29.020
I realized that if people die unable to adapt to this world,

01:47:29.230 --> 01:47:33.530
it's better to stop being humans with consciousness.

01:47:33.740 --> 01:47:37.740
It's better to throw away "being myself."

01:47:37.950 --> 01:47:42.330
And become a world without pain or consciousness?

01:47:42.540 --> 01:47:47.710
Correct. The adults were of the opinion that loss of consciousness is synonymous with death.

01:47:47.920 --> 01:47:51.210
So they tried to cover it up.

01:47:51.420 --> 01:47:54.050
Your father as well.

01:47:55.920 --> 01:48:01.720
There are also people living in this world who feel happy the way things are now.

01:48:01.930 --> 01:48:03.970
Like Cian.

01:48:04.890 --> 01:48:07.850
Was Cian truly happy?

01:48:10.900 --> 01:48:16.990
And you, Tuan--you've suffered and rejected this world all along.

01:48:19.700 --> 01:48:25.790
You know, Tuan, humans are hopelessly animal and barbaric.

01:48:26.000 --> 01:48:28.540
But, humans can change.

01:48:28.750 --> 01:48:32.380
This consciousness that's a mere patchwork of functions supplied by nature...

01:48:32.590 --> 01:48:35.340
I'll evolve it into something free of suffering.

01:48:35.550 --> 01:48:38.220
I'll change humanity into a social existence.

01:48:38.430 --> 01:48:42.600
Humans can break through the limitations of consciousness.

01:48:43.810 --> 01:48:46.930
The elders will surely activate Harmony!

01:48:47.140 --> 01:48:49.900
That is the only choice now!

01:48:50.100 --> 01:48:53.360
I'll bring everyone into my world.

01:48:53.570 --> 01:48:57.990
Everyone will come into my world without suffering.

01:49:21.720 --> 01:49:24.220
You never change, do you?

01:49:24.430 --> 01:49:26.140
That's kind of a relief.

01:49:26.350 --> 01:49:34.520
Smart, selfish, pure, brutal, a bit lonely...

01:49:34.730 --> 01:49:38.860
You wanted to return to that place without consciousness, didn't you?

01:49:39.070 --> 01:49:41.360
To where you were born.

01:49:44.660 --> 01:49:52.330
You haven't thought one bit about what I came to this place to do.

01:49:55.000 --> 01:49:59.630
A fake utopia and a world devoid of consciousness and individuality...

01:49:59.840 --> 01:50:03.510
Someday humanity may go down that path.

01:50:03.720 --> 01:50:08.970
Tuan, let's go. To the world of Harmony.

01:50:09.180 --> 01:50:10.600
Yeah.

01:50:23.030 --> 01:50:29.620
I was always chasing you, Miach.
And I still am...

01:50:29.830 --> 01:50:37.290
If you wish for the world of Harmony, then I'll accept that world.

01:50:37.500 --> 01:50:40.340
But Miach...

01:50:43.630 --> 01:50:46.890
...you're the one person
I won't allow to go there.

01:50:47.100 --> 01:50:50.970
Stay as the Miach I loved!

01:51:00.690 --> 01:51:03.570
I love you, Miach.

01:52:40.750 --> 01:52:42.040
This is a business card.

01:52:42.250 --> 01:52:47.130
A long time ago, adults used paper like this to introduce themselves.

01:52:47.340 --> 01:52:48.260
No way.

01:52:48.470 --> 01:52:50.050
It's cute, isn't it?

01:52:50.260 --> 01:52:52.930
Sure is. It's so cute.

01:52:53.140 --> 01:52:55.310
Did you draw this logo?

01:52:55.520 --> 01:52:58.480
That's right. It's our logo.

01:52:58.690 --> 01:52:59.770
Ours?

01:52:59.980 --> 01:53:07.320
Yeah, we three comrades.
Me, Cian, and you.

01:53:50.800 --> 01:53:50.840
<i: Goodbye, me.>

01:53:50.800 --> 01:53:50.840
<i: Goodbye, soul.>

01:53:53.050 --> 01:53:53.090
<i: I don't suppose we'll meet again.>

01:56:11.840 --> 01:56:16.880
mite yozora o kyou wa

01:56:11.840 --> 01:56:16.880
Look at the sky today...

01:56:17.090 --> 01:56:25.930
konna nimo hareteiru yo dakara

01:56:17.090 --> 01:56:25.930
Since it's so sunny,

01:56:26.140 --> 01:56:29.650
sanpo demo shi ni ikanai

01:56:26.140 --> 01:56:29.650
Why don't we go for a walk?

01:56:29.850 --> 01:56:36.320
nakanaori ga shitainda boku wa

01:56:29.850 --> 01:56:36.320
Even though I told you

01:56:36.530 --> 01:56:42.240
kimi ni sou ittanda yo nanoni

01:56:36.530 --> 01:56:42.240
That I want to make things right with you,

01:56:42.450 --> 01:56:45.870
kimi wa shiranpuri o shiteru

01:56:42.450 --> 01:56:45.870
You're pretending not to notice

01:56:46.080 --> 01:56:49.670
mita koto nai you na kao de

01:56:46.080 --> 01:56:49.670
With an expression that I've never seen before.

01:56:49.870 --> 01:56:56.670
sonnani okoraseta nara ayamaru yo

01:56:49.870 --> 01:56:56.670
I apologize if I've made you that angry.

01:56:56.880 --> 01:57:12.880
tokorode sakki kara doushite kimi wa zutto naiteru no

01:56:56.880 --> 01:57:12.880
By the way, why have you been crying all this time?

01:57:15.270 --> 01:57:22.620
marude boku ga inai mitai ni sa

01:57:15.270 --> 01:57:22.620
It's as if I'm not here.

01:57:22.820 --> 01:57:30.290
kimi wa mata sou yatte ijiwaru suru yo

01:57:22.820 --> 01:57:30.290
You're being mean again like that.

01:57:30.500 --> 01:57:37.880
kasaneta te o nigirishimete

01:57:30.500 --> 01:57:37.880
I clasp our hands together,

01:57:38.090 --> 01:57:45.970
kimi wa kedo boku niwa kidzukanai yo

01:57:38.090 --> 01:57:45.970
But you don't notice me.

01:58:16.210 --> 01:58:23.470
boku no bun made warawanakute ii

01:58:16.210 --> 01:58:23.470
It's okay not to smile for me

01:58:23.680 --> 01:58:31.230
dakara boku no bun made nakanakute ii

01:58:23.680 --> 01:58:31.230
And it's okay not to cry for me.

01:58:31.430 --> 01:58:38.820
toki wa yagate kimi o iyashi

01:58:31.430 --> 01:58:38.820
Before long time will comfort you

01:58:39.030 --> 01:58:46.370
ima o kako no mono ni shitekureru yo

01:58:39.030 --> 01:58:46.370
And make the present a thing of the past.

01:58:46.570 --> 01:58:54.040
kyou wa konna ni hareteru kara

01:58:46.570 --> 01:58:54.040
Because it's so sunny today.

01:58:54.250 --> 01:59:03.720
kimi ga moshi yokereba sanpo demo shi ni ikou

01:58:54.250 --> 01:59:03.720
If it's alright with you, let's go for a walk...

01:59:07.300 --> 01:59:13.100
kimi ni aitai

01:59:07.300 --> 01:59:13.100
I want to see you

01:59:13.310 --> 01:59:19.820
kokoro kara omou

01:59:13.310 --> 01:59:19.820
From the bottom of my heart.
